P2 load-validated-theme-from-bytes (Aether Serial Bridge, master §3.4 / WS-2; INV-52, INV-84)

(a) loadThemeFromPath() becomes "read the file" + the private loader
    loadThemeFromJson(bytes, origin).
(b) loadThemeFromJson() clears ALL previously loaded state before seeding:
    m_tokens (the root scope's tokens, previously never cleared, so a root
    token from theme A survived into theme B), the child scopes, the
    primitives, and the factory-snapshot latch.
(c) public bool activateValidatedTheme(name, json): loads exactly the given
    bytes, sets the active name and emits themeChanged(); it touches no
    AppSettings, no m_themePaths and no file, and a failed load leaves the
    previous theme in place.

Carries a GPL-3.0 section 5(a) modification notice. Offered upstream (R1);
(b) also fixes an upstream stale-token bug.
Test: tests/tst_ThemePatches.cpp (activatesFromBytesOnly,
rootTokenFromPreviousThemeCleared, builtInsThroughSameRoute,
replaceAfterValidationHasNoEffect, failedActivationKeepsPreviousTheme).

